OL,3,GNEWSAParades commissioner resigns after
OL,4,ADrumcree case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA member of the Parades Commission has
OL,7,Fresigned after a court case highlighted
OL,8,Fmistakes over its ruling on the Orange
OL,9,FOrder's Drumcree parade.
OL,11,FBilly Gamble had faced the most public
OL,12,Fcriticism over private comments he is
OL,13,Falleged to have made about the parade
OL,14,Fdetermination.
OL,16,FThe chair of the Parades Commission,
OL,17,FProf Evelyn Collins, had said the
OL,18,Fcomments were "out of line" but had no
OL,19,Fbearing on the decision-making process.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
